taxRate.title = Tax rate
taxRate.heading = Tax rate
taxRate.p1 = For most securities transfers, you will be charged a tax rate of 0.5% of the consideration.
taxRate.p2 = If the securities are being transferred into a ‘depository receipt scheme’ or a ‘clearance service’, you will need to pay the 1.5% tax rate in most circumstances. This is usually where the transfer is not integral to capital raising or where the clearance service has elected to remain in the 0.5% regime.
taxRate.legend = What is the tax rate for this transfer?
taxRate.half = 0.5%
taxRate.oneAndHalf = 1.5%
taxRate.checkYourAnswersLabel = Tax rate
