templateInstructions.title = How to use the template
templateInstructions.heading = How to use the template
templateInstructions.p1 = Use the template to tell us about more than one securities transfer at a time.
templateInstructions.step1 = Download the template
templateInstructions.step2 = Complete the template, using one row for each type of securities you are buying
templateInstructions.step3 = Upload your file on the next page as a .xlsx or .csv
templateInstructions.p2 = Remember, do not edit the first two rows, or change the order of the columns.
templateInstructions.p3.span1 = Once you have uploaded and submitted your file it will show on your
templateInstructions.p3.a = STC dashboard
templateInstructions.p3.span2 = You can then pay any charges due.
return-to-dashboard.link = Return to dashboard

formattingError.title = Your file has formatting errors
formattingError.heading = Your file has formatting errors
formattingError.p1 = More than 25 formatting errors have been detected in this file.
formattingError.p2 = The errors may include things like incorrect formatting of numbers or dates, or letters in a cell that can only contain numbers.
formattingError.p3 = These will need to be corrected before your file can be uploaded again.
formattingError.p4 = Check the instructions in the template file for more guidance.

