fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.title = The template file you uploaded has been changed
fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.heading = The template file you uploaded has been changed
fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.p.start = You must
fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.p.link = use the template file
fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.p.end = to record details of the transfers, and upload this file.
fileUpload.error.invalidTemplate.p2 = Remember, do not edit the first two rows, or change the order of the columns in the template.

agent.templateInstructions.title = How to use the template
agent.templateInstructions.heading = How to use the template
agent.templateInstructions.p1 = Use the template to tell us about more than one securities transfer at a time.
agent.templateInstructions.step1 = Download the template
agent.templateInstructions.step2 = Complete the template, using one row for each transfer between a buyer and seller
agent.templateInstructions.step3 = Upload the file on the next page as a .xlsx or .csv
agent.templateInstructions.p2 = Remember, do not edit the first two rows, or change the order of the columns.
agent.templateInstructions.p3 = Once you have uploaded and submitted the file, it may take a few minutes to process before showing as ‘ready to pay’ on your dashboard. You can then pay the charges due.

bulk.agentReference.hint = You can add a reference for your own records and to help you find this submission later. It will not be used by HMRC
submission.details.caption = Submission details

sh03.section.name =  Share buyback (SH03)

submissionsDashboard.sh03.button = start sh03
sh03.beforeYouStart.title = Before you start
sh03.beforeYouStart.heading = Before you start
sh03.beforeYouStart.p1 = Use this service to submit details about a purchase of a limited company’s own shares, and pay the charges due.
sh03.beforeYouStart.p2 = You can use this online service to tell us about the purchase, instead of the Companies House SH03 form.
sh03.beforeYouStart.p3 = Once you have submitted details about the purchase you will get a printable confirmation including the transfer reference number, which can be sent to Companies House.
sh03.beforeYouStart.p4 = You do not need to tell us about transfers where the company is a Qualifying Asset Holding Company, and the conditions for exemption are met.

agent.sh03.agentReference.hint = You can add a reference for your own records and to help you find this transfer later. It will not be used by HMRC

