agent.sh03.chargingPoint.title = Charging point
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.heading = Charging point
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.p1 = Any tax due on this share buyback must be paid 30 days from the charging point.
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.p2 = The charging point is the date the share buyback is substantially completed. For example, the date when:
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.bullet1 = all or the majority of the consideration is paid
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.bullet2 = the buyer can exercise rights or receive benefits associated with owning the shares
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.p3 = Find out
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.link.text = more about charging points
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.heading2 = What is the charging point for this share buyback?
agent.sh03.chargingPoint.hint = For example, 27 3 2024
