agent.sh03.bulk.companyDetails.title = Company details
agent.sh03.bulk.companyDetails.heading = Company details
agent.sh03.bulk.companyDetails.companyName.label = Company name
agent.sh03.bulk.companyDetails.crn.label = Company registration number (CRN)
agent.sh03.bulk.companyDetails.crn.hint = This is also called a company number. For example, SN898989 or 12345678

agent.sh03.templateInstructions.title = How to use the template
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.heading = How to use the template
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.p1 = Use the template to tell us about more than one share purchase at a time.
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.step1 = Download the template
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.step2 = Complete the template, using one row for each class of shares the company is purchasing.
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.step3 = Upload the file on the next page as a .csv or an .xlsx
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.p2 = Remember, do not edit the first three rows, or change the order of the columns.
agent.sh03.templateInstructions.p3 = Once you have uploaded and submitted the file it will show in your recent submissions, you can then pay the tax due.


